/ N,M in decimal 0..32767.
/ Product from repeated addition, or -1 on invalid input/overflow.
ORG 100
Input
Store N
Skipcond 000
Jump ReadM
Jump Error
ReadM, Input
Store M
Skipcond 000
Jump Choose
Jump Error
Choose, Load N
Subt M
Skipcond 000
Jump NAtLeastM
Jump NLessM
NAtLeastM, Load N
Store Big
Load M
Store Count
Jump Init
NLessM, Load M
Store Big
Load N
Store Count
Init, Clear
Store Product
LoopCheck, Load Count
Skipcond 400
Jump CheckAdd
Jump Done
CheckAdd, Load MaxValue
Subt Product
Subt Big
Skipcond 000
Jump AddSafe
Jump Error
AddSafe, Load Product
Add Big
Store Product
Load Count
Subt One
Store Count
Jump LoopCheck
Done, Load Product
Output
Halt
Error, Load NegOne
Output
Halt
N, DEC 0
M, DEC 0
Big, DEC 0
Count, DEC 0
Product, DEC 0
One, DEC 1
MaxValue, DEC 32767
NegOne, DEC -1
END
